<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 4.433 billion pesos in the secondary market on Tuesday through four credit auctions, and assigned the first credit at 24.40 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.216 bln  10 days   24.40 pct</p>
<p>    1.217 bln   8 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   2 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
